Package: sldesign
Title: Skip-Levels Design for Phase I Oncology Study
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Weibin", "Zhong", , "wzhong3@gmu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jing-ou", "Liu", , " ", role = "aut"),
    person("chenguang", "Wang", , " ", role = "aut"))
Description: A tool to calculate the sufficient range of the response rates that the skip-levels (SL) design performs better than the uniformly-assign (UA) design, as well as conduct simulation studies for the phase 1 dose-escalation and dose-expansion using the SL design or the UA design and find the recommended phase 2 dose admissible region using Bayesian 2-parameter logistic regression.
